    prompt smooth bowed glass harmonics wavering in overlapping irregular phrases, rounded sustained tones without strikes, dry close recording, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 30
    loopable

gen outer_water_resonance
    prompt low hollow fluid resonance from slowly deforming water cavities, continuous rounded drone with irregular organic pitch sag, no pulses or impacts, dry close recording, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 30
    loopable

gen sleeping_bud_a
    prompt small elastic water membrane resonating with a breathy vowel-like murmur, unstable sustained pitch slipping slowly around one note, irregular gentle tension changes, no syllables or pulses, dry close recording, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 30
    loopable

gen sleeping_bud_b
    prompt small gelatinous water capsule resonating with a breathy rounded murmur, sustained tone bending and loosening irregularly around one note, smooth organic delivery without attacks, dry close recording, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 29
    loopable

gen warm_water_harmonics
    prompt sustained rounded liquid harmonics in a low open fifth, smooth irregular interweaving overtones from a resonating water membrane, no attacks or pulses, dry close recording, seamless ambience loop, consistent texture
    duration 30
    loopable

